 R←Test_Stash_013(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;rc;msg;buff;dir
⍝ Executes StashListContent with APL names
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 dir←⊃{⍺,'/',⍵}/#.Proj_1.CiderConfig.(HOME CIDER.source)
 Assert' '=1↑0⍴#.Proj_1.⎕FX↑{(⍵[1]),(⊂'⍝ '),(⍵[≢⍵])}⎕NR'#.Proj_1.WhoAmI'
 {}⎕SE.Link.Add'#.Proj_1.WhoAmI'
 buff←##.APLGit2.StashPush dir
 Assert∨/'Saved working directory and index state WIP on main:'⍷∊buff
 →T.GoToTidyUp 1≠≢##.APLGit2.StashList dir

 buff←##.APLGit2.StashListContent'#.Proj_1' 0
 →T.GoToTidyUp~F.IsFile buff[;1]
 →T.GoToTidyUp(,⊂'#.Proj_1.WhoAmI')≢buff[;2]

 R←T._OK

∆TidyUp:
 ##.APLGit2.StashClear dir
⍝Done
